* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|terrorblade_reflection_slow}} to all {{M|visible}} enemy heroes within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
**#* Considers enemy {{M|clones}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
**#* {{M|Dispelling}} the debuff {{M|instant kills}} the Reflection-based illusion.
**# {{Symbol|Illusions}}
**#* Creates {{A|Terrorblade|Reflection}}-based {{M|illusions}} of all debuff-affected enemy units, with the following properties:
**#** {{M|Hidden}}
**#** {{M|Invulnerable}}
**#** {{Symbol|Movement Speed}}
**#*** Has an [[Movement speed#Absolute Movement Speed|absolute]] {{#var:Reflection type1 value2}}-[[movement speed]].
**#*** Has {{M|unobstructed movement}}.
**#** {{M|Spell immune}}
**#** {{M|Untargetable}}
**#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**#*** Visually distinguishable from the debuff-affected enemy hero for everyone.
**#** {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
**#*** Grants the same vision values corresponding to the debuff-affected enemy hero's vision radius.
**#* Spawns either [[File:Dota2 North.png|31px|North]] , [[File:Dota2 South.png|31px|South]] , [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px|East]] or [[File:Dota2 West.png|31px|West]] from the debuff-affected enemy  hero.
**#** {{Symbol|Illusform|1}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|1a}}
**#* Bestows all the {{M|aura}} and all functional abilities that illusions can utilize from the affected enemy hero.
**#* {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
**#** The created illusions attempt to attack its corresponding targets, and attacks their targets when they have {{M|vision}} over them.
**#** If the corresponding target cannot be attacked, they home in to the targets close enough until they can be attacked again, including when the targets are affected by the following sources:
**#*** Moves into the {{M|Fog of War}}.
**#*** {{M|Hidden}}
**#*** {{M|Invisibility}}

* Has the following additional properties:
** Recasting the ability creates another independent Reflection-based illusion instance per affected enemy hero.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} Grants the following bonuses to Reflection-based illusions upon {{A|Terrorblade|Demon Zeal}} cast:
** Flat bonus {{M|movement speed}}.
** Flat bonus {{M|attack speed}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Metamorphosis icon0}}
| desc = Terrorblade transforms into a powerful demon with a ranged attack. Any of Terrorblade's illusions that are within 1200 range will also be transformed by Metamorphosis.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Has no effect on Terrorblade's {{M|base attack time}}.
** This only affects casters with a different base attack time.

 * {{Symbol|a|Transfer}}
** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** Cannot directly be {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted on the following sources:
*** {{M|Debuff immune}} units.
*** The {{H|Spirit Bear}}, but the unit can be indirectly affected by {{M|spell redirection}} sources.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** {{M|Disable Help}} on Terrorblade prevents Sunder from affecting the allied unit's {{M|current health}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** [[Setting Health|Sets]] both Terrorblade's and the unit target's health utilizing the following formulas, with the following sequence:
**# {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**#* {{Code|Caster %CurrentHP ➜ MAX(({{#var:Sunder value2}} - {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Terrorblade|v2l}}%|tal|x}}) of Target %CurrentHP)}}
**#** Sets Terrorblade's current health utilizing {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit's current health.
**#** This ability component bypasses {{M|debuff immune}} sources on Terrorblade.
**# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{to}}
**#* {{Code|Target %Current[[Health|HP]] ➜ MAX(({{#var:Sunder value2}} - {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Terrorblade|v2l}}%|tal|x}}) of Caster %CurrentHP)}}
**#** Sets the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit's health utilizing Terrorblade's current health.
**#*** {{cf|talnotes}} When cast on a unit-targeted enemy, {{Code|Target %CurrentHP ➜ Caster %CurrentHP}}.
**#** This ability component considers {{M|debuff immune}} sources on the targeted unit.

